   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"7\">\n  <li>A function <span data-math=\"g(x) = (2x)^2 - 5\">g(x) = (2x)^2 - 5</span> was transformed from the parent quadratic function. Which of the following answer choices describes the transformations that were applied?&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Select the<strong> two</strong> descriptions that apply.</p>\n<ol type=\"a\">\n  <li>A horizontal shift 2 units to the right</li>\n  <li>A horizontal dilation by a factor of 2</li>\n  <li>A horizontal shift left 5 units</li>\n  <li>A vertical shift down 5 units</li>\n  <li>A vertical dilation by a factor of 2</li>\n</ol>",
